// Every item, with its fixed stats and its price (what a shop sells it for; shops pay
// SELL_SHARE of it, more where the town wants it). Gear is one to a slot; materials stack.
// Fine versions add FINE_BONUS to the stats and sell for FINE_VALUE times as much
// (crates/content/src/items.rs). Weapon keys are the gear catalogue's and the combat tables'.
(
    items: [
        // Weapons, tier 1. Stats are what wielding one adds (gear isn't applied to fights yet, #17).
